#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_hide_json.php:29
msgid "JSON REST"
msgstr "JSON REST"

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_hide_json.php:32
msgid ""
"The WordPress REST API is an easy-to-use set of HTTP endpoints which allows access "
"a site data in simple JSON format. That including users, posts, taxonomies and "
"more. Retrieving or updating is as simple as sending a HTTP request.\n"
"                                                                <br />A REST API "
"can be consumed everywhere. On mobile applications, on front-end (web apps) or any "
"other devices that have access on the net, practically everything can connect from "
"anywhere to your site and interact though JSON REST API service."
msgstr ""
"De WordPress REST API is een gebruiksvriendelijke set HTTP-eindpunten die toegang "
"biedt tot sitedata in eenvoudig JSON-formaat. Dat omvat gebruikers, berichten, "
"taxonomieën en meer. Ophalen of bijwerken is zo eenvoudig als het versturen van "
"een HTTP-verzoek.\n"
"                                                                <br />Een REST API "
"kan overal worden gebruikt. Op mobiele applicaties, op de front-end (webapps) of "
"andere apparaten die toegang hebben tot het net, praktisch alles kan van overal "
"verbinding maken met uw site en interacteren via de JSON REST API-service."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_hide_json.php:58
msgid ""
