msgstr "FOUT: Verificatiecode verlopen."

#: modules/components/login_2fa_email.php:337
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Authentication codes will be securely sent to the email address ( %s ) associated "
"with your account. This added layer of security ensures that only you can access "
"your account, even if your password is compromised. Make sure your email address "
"is up-to-date to receive these important codes promptly."
msgstr ""
"Authenticatiecodes worden veilig verzonden naar het e-mailadres ( %s ) dat aan uw "
"account is gekoppeld. Deze extra beveiligingslaag zorgt ervoor dat alleen u "
