#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:84
msgid "Won't allow loading of any resources."
msgstr "Laadt geen bronnen."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:84
#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:85
msgid "Only allow resources from the current origin."
msgstr "Alleen bronnen van de huidige oorsprong toestaan."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:85
#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:86
msgid ""
"The trust granted to a script in the page due to an accompanying nonce or hash is "
"extended to the scripts it loads."
msgstr ""
"Het vertrouwen dat aan een script op de pagina is verleend vanwege een "
"bijbehorende nonce of hash, wordt uitgebreid tot de scripts die het laadt."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:86
#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:87
msgid ""
"Require a sample of the violating code to be included in the violation report."
msgstr ""
"Vereist dat een voorbeeld van de overtredende code wordt opgenomen in het "
"overtredingsrapport."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:87
#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:88
msgid "Allow use of inline resources."
msgstr "Gebruik van inline-bronnen toestaan."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:88
#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:89
msgid ""
"Allow use of dynamic code evaluation such as eval, setImmediate , and window."
"execScript."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik van dynamische code-evaluatie toestaan, zoals eval, setImmediate en window."
"execScript."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:89
#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:90
msgid ""
"Only allow loading of resources from a specific host, with optional scheme, port, "
"and path. e.g. example.com, *.example.com, https://*.example.com:12/path/to/file."
"js."
msgstr ""
"Alleen het laden van bronnen toestaan vanaf een specifieke host, met optioneel "
"schema, poort en pad. bijv. example.com, *.example.com, https://*.example.com:12/"
"path/to/file.js."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:90
#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:91
msgid ""
"Path parts in the CSP that end in / match any path they are a prefix of. e.g. "
"example.com/api/ will match URLs like example.com/api/users/new."
msgstr ""
"Pad-onderdelen in de CSP die eindigen op / komen overeen met elk pad waarvan ze "
"een voorvoegsel zijn. bijv. example.com/api/ komt overeen met URL's zoals example."
"com/api/users/new."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:91
#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:92
msgid ""
"Other path parts in the CSP are matched exactly e.g. example.com/file.js will "
"match http://example.com/file.js and https://example.com/file.js, but not https://"
"example.com/file.js/file2.js."
msgstr ""
"Andere pad-onderdelen in de CSP worden exact gematcht. bijv. example.com/file.js "
"komt overeen met http://example.com/file.js en https://example.com/file.js, maar "
"niet met https://example.com/file.js/file2.js."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:92
#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:93
msgid ""
"Only allow loading of resources over a specific scheme e.g. https:, http:, data:, "
"mediastream:, blob:, filesystem:"
msgstr ""
"Alleen het laden van bronnen toestaan via een specifiek schema, bijv. https:, "
"http:, data:, mediastream:, blob:, filesystem:"

