#: modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:51
msgid ""
"The Referrer-Policy HTTP header determines the amount of referral information "
"(sent through the Referer header) that should accompany requests. In addition to "
"the HTTP header, this policy can also be set in HTML"
msgstr ""
"De Referrer-Policy HTTP header bepaalt de hoeveelheid verwijzingsinformatie "
"(verzonden via de Referer header) die met verzoeken moet worden meegestuurd. Naast "
"de HTTP-header kan dit beleid ook worden ingesteld in HTML"

#: modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:53
msgid ""
